;\"> (15\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:50<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 8.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (31\/07\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 9.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (30\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (15\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Kids<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 24 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">0.00 \u20ac<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o centro nevr\u00e1lgico do 13\u00ba Trail de F\u00e1tima 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre no fim de semana de 24 e 25 de outubro de 2026, com secretariado e meta principal sediados no Sal\u00e3o Paroquial de F\u00e1tima, concelho de Our\u00e9m.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e os hor\u00e1rios de partida no domingo?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No domingo partem o Trail Ultra de 45 km (07:30, com transporte de autocarro \u00e0s 06:45), Trail Longo de 30 km (08:30), Mini Trail de 12 km (09:20), Trail Curto de 17 km (09:30) e a Caminhada de 12 km (09:50).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os desn\u00edveis acumulados de cada dist\u00e2ncia?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Ultra apresenta aproximadamente 1.800 m D+, o Trail Longo conta com 1.400 m D+, o Trail Curto tem 900 m D+ e o Mini Trail soma cerca de 500 m D+.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam as provas de s\u00e1bado, 24 de outubro?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No s\u00e1bado \u00e0 tarde disputam-se a C\u00e3ominhada (14:30), para tutores e os seus c\u00e3es, e o Trail Kids (16:00), com inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita e provas adaptadas aos jovens dos 5 aos 15 anos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de participante oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o contempla dorsal personalizado com chip eletr\u00f3nico de cronometragem da Recorde Pessoal, seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos refor\u00e7ados, banhos, refei\u00e7\u00e3o final e lembran\u00e7a finisher.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail F\u00e1tima 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-24\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Sal\u00e3o Paroquial de F\u00e1tima\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Our\u00e9m\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o F\u00e1tima Trail Team e Munic\u00edpio de Our\u00e9m\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o centro nevr\u00e1lgico do 13\u00ba Trail de F\u00e1tima 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento decorre no fim de semana de 24 e 25 de outubro de 2026, com secretariado e meta principal sediados no Sal\u00e3o Paroquial de F\u00e1tima, concelho de Our\u00e9m.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e os hor\u00e1rios de partida no domingo?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No domingo partem o Trail Ultra de 45 km (07:30, com transporte de autocarro \u00e0s 06:45), Trail Longo de 30 km (08:30), Mini Trail de 12 km (09:20), Trail Curto de 17 km (09:30) e a Caminhada de 12 km (09:50).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os desn\u00edveis acumulados de cada dist\u00e2ncia?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail Ultra apresenta aproximadamente 1.800 m D+, o Trail Longo conta com 1.400 m D+, o Trail Curto tem 900 m D+ e o Mini Trail soma cerca de 500 m D+.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam as provas de s\u00e1bado, 24 de outubro?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No s\u00e1bado \u00e0 tarde disputam-se a C\u00e3ominhada (14:30), para tutores e os seus c\u00e3es, e o Trail Kids (16:00), com inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita e provas adaptadas aos jovens dos 5 aos 15 anos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o kit de participante oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o contempla dorsal personalizado com chip eletr\u00f3nico de cronometragem da Recorde Pessoal, seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos refor\u00e7ados, banhos, refei\u00e7\u00e3o final e lembran\u00e7a finisher.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68615,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,672,624,497,498,499],"event_type_2":[39,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51799","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-ourem-santarem","event_type-trail","event_type-caminhada","event_type-kids","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-santarem","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-trail-fatim